{
  "mentor_tip": {
    "title": "慢半步",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "师父，刚才那一剑，我明明已经快了，怎么还是收不住？",
        "voice": "opening",
        "next": "sit"
      },
      "sit": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "过来坐。你这口气，还留在剑坪上呢。",
        "voice": "sit",
        "next": "hurry"
      },
      "hurry": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "我就是想早些练好，免得总让您等。",
        "voice": "hurry",
        "next": "advice"
      },
      "advice": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "剑快一点不难。难的是出剑时，心里不抢那一步。",
        "voice": "advice",
        "next": "choice"
      },
      "choice": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "先陪我听一会儿雨。等肩膀松了，再想刚才那一剑。",
        "voice": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "take_lesson",
            "label": "坐下来，随师父调息（精力8 · 1时辰）",
            "next": "lesson_taken",
            "action": "claim_mentor_lesson",
            "conditions": {
              "stats_gte": {
                "energy": 8
              },
              "flags": {
                "mentor_lesson_accepted": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "return_to_practice",
            "label": "先回去自己试试",
            "next": "lesson_skipped",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {}
          }
        ]
      },
      "lesson_taken": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "好，我不抢。先把这一口气放稳。",
        "voice": "lesson_taken",
        "next": "lesson_reply"
      },
      "lesson_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "这就对了。待会儿再出剑，记住此刻肩上的轻松。",
        "voice": "lesson_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "lesson_skipped": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "那我先去试试。要是还不对，我再来找您。",
        "voice": "lesson_skipped",
        "next": "skip_reply"
      },
      "skip_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "去吧。慢半步，也无妨。",
        "voice": "skip_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "end": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "这番话先记在心里。下一次修习，看看剑势是否更稳。",
        "set_flags": {
          "mentor_lesson_heard": true
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "mentor_practice_report": {
    "title": "练剑回报",
    "start": "report_question",
    "nodes": {
      "report_question": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "方才那套剑，练得如何？",
        "voice": "report_question",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "with_lesson",
            "label": "说说调息后的体会",
            "next": "report_calm",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "mentor_lesson_accepted": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "self_practice",
            "label": "说说自己试剑的体会",
            "next": "report_try",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "mentor_lesson_accepted": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "later",
            "label": "稍后再向师父回报",
            "next": "laterend",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {}
          }
        ]
      },
      "report_calm": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "这回我没急着抢那一步，剑也收稳了。",
        "voice": "report_calm",
        "next": "report_calm_reply"
      },
      "report_calm_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "嗯，先记住这份从容。明日再练，不必把今天的力气都用尽。",
        "voice": "report_calm_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "report_try": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "player_yanqiu",
        "text": "刚才还是有些急，不过我知道该从哪儿改了。",
        "voice": "report_try",
        "next": "report_try_reply"
      },
      "report_try_reply": {
        "type": "say",
        "speaker": "mentor_zhixian",
        "text": "知道哪里急，就有了进步。先歇歇，明日再来。",
        "voice": "report_try_reply",
        "next": "end"
      },
      "end": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "今日听教与练剑已记下，歇息后仍可继续修行。",
        "set_flags": {
          "mentor_reported": true
        }
      },
      "laterend": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "今日练剑已记录，稍后仍可回廊复命。"
      }
    }
  },
  "chengdu_keeper_first": {
    "title": "柜前相遇",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "chengdu_narration",
        "text": "掌柜把柜上的杯盏排齐，指向窗边留空的木架。架旁有字：城中拾得的物件，可暂放此处等人认领。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "see_rack",
            "label": "顺着手势看看失物架",
            "next": "rack",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "leave",
            "label": "点头致意，继续逛逛",
            "next": "leave",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "rack": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "木架就在窗边。若在河岸见到待认领的物件，可自行决定是否顺路带来。"
      },
      "leave": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "你记住了这处茶馆，转身继续闲逛。"
      }
    }
  },
  "chengdu_keeper_again": {
    "title": "柜前重逢",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "chengdu_narration",
        "text": "掌柜记得你先前来过，给柜前留出同一角空位。茶馆与街巷仍可慢慢逛。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "see_returned",
            "label": "看看已经归架的竹伞",
            "next": "returned",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "chengdu_umbrella_returned": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "leave",
            "label": "点头致意，继续逛逛",
            "next": "leave",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "returned": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "上回带回的竹伞仍在窗边失物架，东城河街的木签夹在伞绳上。掌柜也记得你送来的这一趟。"
      },
      "leave": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "先前的问候还在，离开后再来，掌柜仍会认得你。"
      }
    }
  },
  "chengdu_guest_first": {
    "title": "窗边经过",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "chengdu_narration",
        "text": "窗边茶客侧身给你让路，指了指池岸和楼影。桌上摊着一张画得简单的城中街路图。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "look_map",
            "label": "看看茶桌旁的街路图",
            "next": "map",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "leave",
            "label": "轻轻点头，继续逛逛",
            "next": "leave",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "map": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "图上标着南门与万里桥的主街，摩诃池和散花楼偏在西侧。茶馆前门接石室街，后门通池岸；东城的大慈寺前有药市，城外西边另有草堂与宫祠。"
      },
      "leave": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "茶客收回手，继续看窗外。你可以随时离开茶馆。"
      }
    }
  },
  "chengdu_guest_again": {
    "title": "窗边重逢",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "chengdu_narration",
        "text": "茶客认出先前经过的人，又把长凳收进桌下。窗外的池岸与楼影仍在。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "look_map",
            "label": "再看看城中方向",
            "next": "map",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "leave",
            "label": "点头后继续逛逛",
            "next": "leave",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "map": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "从茶馆可沿前街去南门，也可走池岸绕到子城前，再转往大慈寺与河边。城墙的南门、西门与东桥门都留着可走的通路。"
      },
      "leave": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "你点头走过，茶客也向你点点头。先前那次照面，他还记得。"
      }
    }
  },
  "chengdu_river_umbrella": {
    "title": "临河竹伞",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "chengdu_narration",
        "text": "木架上挂着失物牌：拾得物件，可送摩诃池南边茶馆的失物架。伞绳上还留着水痕。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "take",
            "label": "顺路带竹伞回茶馆",
            "next": "taken",
            "action": "take_river_umbrella",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "chengdu_umbrella_taken": false,
                "chengdu_umbrella_returned": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "carrying",
            "label": "看看木架留下的空钩",
            "next": "carrying",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "chengdu_umbrella_carrying": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "returned",
            "label": "记起已送回茶馆的竹伞",
            "next": "returned",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "chengdu_umbrella_returned": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "leave",
            "label": "先不管它，继续闲逛",
            "next": "leave",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "taken": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "竹伞已随身带好。可沿城中街路回池南茶馆前门，也可绕过池楼走后门；窗边失物架留着暂存的位置。"
      },
      "carrying": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "木钩已经空了。竹伞正由你带着，茶馆窗边留着暂存的位置。"
      },
      "returned": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "这里的木钩仍空着。你记得已经把竹伞送到茶馆，东城河街的木签也夹在了伞绳上。"
      },
      "leave": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "你从木架旁走开，沿着城东街路继续闲逛。"
      }
    }
  },
  "chengdu_lost_property": {
    "title": "窗边失物架",
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": {
      "opening": {
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "chengdu_narration",
        "text": "木架旁写着：拾得物件，留记来源，暂存待领。你可以看看，也可以继续逛街。",
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "return",
            "label": "把随身竹伞放到架上",
            "next": "returned",
            "action": "return_river_umbrella",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "chengdu_umbrella_carrying": true,
                "chengdu_umbrella_returned": false
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "revisit",
            "label": "看看上回送来的竹伞",
            "next": "remembered",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {
                "chengdu_umbrella_returned": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "leave",
            "label": "先离开失物架",
            "next": "leave",
            "action": "",
            "conditions": {
              "flags": {}
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "returned": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "竹伞已经放好，东城河街的木签也留在伞绳上。等失主来寻，便能在这里认领。"
      },
      "remembered": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "架上仍是上回那柄竹伞，木签记着它从东城河街来。你看了一眼，记起送它回来时的水声。"
      },
      "leave": {
        "type": "end",
        "text": "你收回目光，仍可在茶馆里走动；前门回石室街，后门通摩诃池岸。"
      }
    }
  }
}
